      ],
      "en": "When some of both the Gentiles and the Jews, with their rulers, made a violent attempt to mistreat and stone them,",
      "ko": "이방인과 유대인과 그 관원들이 두 사도를 능욕하며 돌로 치려고 달려드니",
      "source_text_hash": "ca7a71de64916300b3eb9551936a061bf6613ea66f6f57ab27ffd4efd32ddb43",
      "translation_text_hash": "f9976f6424231d251aaaab7750174b4f59404feba92287c911029e31a301a3a8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이방인과 유대인과 그 관원들이 두 사도를 능욕하며 돌로 치려고 달려드니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f9976f6424231d251aaaab7750174b4f59404feba92287c911029e31a301a3a8"
      ]
    },
