      "en": "He was listening to Paul speaking, who, fastening eyes on him and seeing that he had faith to be made whole,",
      "ko": "바울의 말하는 것을 듣거늘 바울이 주목하여 구원받을만한 믿음이 그에게 있는것을 보고",
      "source_text_hash": "f11a1f8367862e43aa2b9f746f0b860eac454aa47b2591d9385843b928dc6ec9",
      "translation_text_hash": "31c9f93ab123cb885c5caad7a3526306f66f85fc536b8df7e0d7e585ee7763c8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
