      "en": "The priest of Jupiter, whose temple was in front of their city, brought oxen and garlands to the gates, and would have made a sacrifice along with the multitudes.",
      "ko": "성밖 쓰스신당의 제사장이 소와 화관들을 가지고 대문 앞에 와서 무리와 함께 제사하고자 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "8ede1eefb685bb7f4a0e630258750f5f7ce0dd71c3a506a5f47fd7a27e569cdf",
      "translation_text_hash": "3e83f04e711b4daa6d95d5b36a54367f2328c054c0b78aeeeba4a85e2148e44f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
